title trim page, loud take opened in FIT: chip "FIT x1", bars as in TRUE (the gain is 0.9 / peak, never taller than the panel)
sizes 720x720
ppmm 800
env CASSETTE_DEMO idle
env CASSETTE_DEMO_PAGE trim
env CASSETTE_LAYOUT_CHECK 1
env CASSETTE_DEMO_WAVE_FIT 1

wait 600
shot trim-loud-fit
expect text "ZOOM"
expect text "SAVE"
expect notext "LAYOUT FAIL"
expect noquit
